; NEW_Triangular_50Pair_SpeedArray_0p1to1mm_K0p55
; NEW 50-pair TRIANGULAR array, 5 rows x 10 sizes (0.1 through 1.0 mm nominal tip spacing)
; P1S / 0.2 mm nozzle / PETG; 10 layers per pair, 0.06 mm layers, total height 0.60 mm
; ALL first layers 5 mm/s. Rows 1-4 upper speeds: 2.5, 5, 7.5, 10 mm/s
; Rows 1-4 commanded width 0.162876, flow ratio 1.4 baked into E
; Row 5: commanded width 0.15 mm, flow ratio 1.4, all layers 5 mm/s
; Nozzle 255 C; bed 70 C; M900 K0.55 L1000 M10; XY purge line 20 mm/s
; PCF off layers 1-3, then layer-time fan 40-90% using 30/12 second thresholds; auxiliary fan off during model
; First/upper acceleration 500/2000 mm/s^2; 10 mm straight intro/outro
; Each object is 2 mirrored paths, completed before moving left-to-right then front-to-back
; Original triangle shapes uniformly scaled from original 0.3 mm baseline; no square waves
; Minimum 1 mm gap between mirrored straight baselines, achieved by rigid translation only
; Commanded widths and flow do not guarantee measured physical bead width
; Static validation only; physical print verification required
; EXECUTABLE_BLOCK_START
M201 X20000 Y20000 Z500 E5000
M203 X500 Y500 Z20 E30
M204 P20000 R5000 T20000
M205 X9.00 Y9.00 Z3.00 E2.50 ; sets the jerk limits, mm/sec
M106 S0
M106 P2 S0
